(
    title: "I Want My Mommy",
    description: Some("The player guides a teddy bear, Teddy, up a six-storey tower — rising not by jumping but by stepping into teleporter beams that carry him from one floor to the next. The first stage is a climb to reach an apple, the second to reach mommy at the top, while monsters patrol the floors; you can bait them by starting up a teleporter and dropping back down. The goal is to clear both stages as fast as you can."),
